        "TileImage": "$($repository c0194374-3f9b-452f-afc4-6102d1ee219d).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47, your targets are a trio of thieves at the Villa Caruso mansion. Our client, mansion-owner Silvio Caruso, discovered the robbers betrayal after he discovered one of them using his sports car to smuggle out his prized gold artifacts collection in what was disguised. Caruso wants them dealt with swiftly and memorably, leaving a warning sign to any possible successors. Good luck, and please, watch out for flying hats.",
